        "target_title": "feat(govern): redact values assigned to credential-like names in text",
        "created_at": "2026-11-09T03:58:40.893Z",
        "note": {
          "id": 4189392833,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The change is well built: matching is bounded and the added cases pass when I trace them by hand. Some secret shapes still slip through. Fixing them is small: one regex tweak, a decision on how to treat brackets in unquoted values, and a docs update. I didn't run the tests. Several test lines show redaction artifacts in the diff view, so I couldn't check them as written.",
          "author": {
            "id": 21826781,
            "username": "GitLabDuo",
            "public_email": null,
            "name": "GitLab Duo",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/21826781/duo-bot.png?v=1792265836",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/GitLabDuo"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-11-09T03:58:39.471Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-11-09T03:58:40.774Z",
